```css
/* baseline: works everywhere — cards stack in normal flow */
.catalog { display: block; }
.catalog > * + * { margin-block-start: 1rem; }

/* enhancement: only where supported */
@supports (container-type: inline-size) {
  .catalog-slot { container-type: inline-size; }
  @container (min-width: 40rem) {
    .catalog { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; }
    .catalog > * + * { margin-block-start: 0; }
  }
}
```

| Technique | Use |
|---|---|
| cascade fallback. | `display: block; display: grid;` — old browsers keep block. |
| `@supports (…)`. | group related enhancement rules. |
| target matrix. | written list of browsers you promise to support. |
| test in real browsers. | or a testing service for the matrix. |

